estamp_created": 1734990270, "timestamp_updated": 1734990270, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183514505", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975219440", "personaname": "Treos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Treos01/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6410, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 627, "last_played": 1785610155, "avatar": "47170d97e4d2560e31c8637819a5a109b06ac98b"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best 40k Games you will play along with some of the best Lore \"Easter Eggs\" through out... if you are in to your 40k this game is for you!", "timestamp_created": 1734990017, "timestamp_updated": 1734990017, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183513589", "author": {"steamid": "76561199485770842", "personaname": "kodcook90", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199485770842/", "num_games_owned": 258, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 847, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 847, "last_played": 1734989012, "avatar": "87e6d3115ae18e73f534cf6c5d384e23a6ebefc5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rating: 9/10\n\nWarhammer 40k: Space Marine 2 is an absolute blast from start to finish. As a third-person shooter, it delivers tight, fluid gameplay that strikes a perfect balance between chaotic melee combat and tactical shooting. Whether you’re shredding through hordes of Tyranids with a bolter or smashing them to bits with a chainsword, every moment feels impactful and satisfying.\n\nThe storytelling is another standout element. The game immerses you in the grim darkness of the 40k universe, with a compelling narrative that captures the brutal and heroic tone of the Space Marines. The voice acting and character moments add depth and tension, making it hard to put down.\n\nVisually, the game is a feast for the eyes. The environments are richly detailed, capturing the gothic, industrial aesthetic of the 40k universe perfectly. The sheer scale of battles, combined with the stunning graphics, makes you feel like a true warrior in humanity’s darkest hours.\n\nThe only thing keeping this from a perfect 10/10 is some minor repetition in enemy encounters, but honestly, the gameplay is so fun you won’t care much.\n\nIf you’re a fan of Warhammer or just love action-packed third-person shooters with incredible storytelling and graphics, this is a must-play. For the Emperor!", "timestamp_created": 1734989273, "timestamp_updated": 1734989273, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183513414", "author": {"steamid": "76561199259947303", "personaname": "Quirk Chungus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199259947303/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 12926, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 329, "last_played": 1783323963, "avatar": "79ebcba5d90a1e6352c33b6e4d0fef176468b3ce"}, "language": "english", "review": "very good game play\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1734989109, "timestamp_updated": 1734989109, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183512502", "author": {"steamid": "76561198214178372", "personaname": "EDGE-LORD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198214178372/", "num_games_owned": 334, "num_reviews": 98, "playtime_forever": 546, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 546, "last_played": 1734978908, "avatar": "991225c2ffd3cc22a159c7f485097bdc3134d935"}, "language": "english", "review": "Finally a new game that isn't Funded by BlackRock and it doesn't have any WOKE messages like the Star Wars Jedi: Survivor and its way better too. I really do like the melee weapons, combos, new guns, and a final boss. I do like the co-op mode which is rare because I usually only play single player games but there's a catch to that.\n\nI feel like this game is more focus on co-op than single player because when making a game that is more focus on co-op or multiplayer like Halo, you have the same game-play restrictions as the multiplayer when playing single player. I don't like the 2 weapon limit but in this game its worse because the first slot you can only carry handguns like the bolt pistols, and the second slot only lets you carry firearms like the bolt rifle, and the game doesn't let you carry 2 firearms. The evade/dodge button doesn't register properly because of its delay and same thing with the parry button. The FPS is stable on my pc for 95% of the time but the second time I get the jet packs the FPS drop to 15-20, and I had to exit the game, verify the files, and start the game again to get it working again. \n\nOverall I give this game a 7 out of 10, I just wish this game didn't remove some of the melee weapons like the Axe and grenade launcher, and I wish they didn't remove the 3 weapon limit like the first game.", "timestamp_created": 1734988323, "timestamp_updated": 1734988323, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.417207896709442139", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183511965", "author": {"steamid": "76561197977795312", "personaname": "Ðæ†h Äg£ñ†", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/death_agent/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 540, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 540, "last_played": 1734987231, "avatar": "eb63657836770923344243915857ff6ad05d28b6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Campaign was very buggy.  Progress was lost frequently which was very frustrating and wasted many hours.  Progress is typically lost AFTER completing an entire operation.", "timestamp_created": 1734987867, "timestamp_updated": 1734987867, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183511748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039635036", "personaname": "Uk'otoa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039635036/", "num_games_owned": 469, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 41182, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1173, "playtime_at_review": 39725, "last_played": 1788978627, "avatar": "abb55e90f2712fa8b33130d27e7b815139764600"}, "language": "english", "review": "Glory to the Emperor! (Also, best CEO at Saber)", "timestamp_created": 1734987689, "timestamp_updated": 1786728615, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weigh